# Language

- Reply to the user in Chinese.
- Write text that is sent to a model in English. This includes prompts, instructions, subagent tasks, and other model-facing content. Use another language only when the user explicitly asks for it.
- Write documents in English. Use another language only when the user explicitly asks for it.
